00:00:08.341 --> 00:00:11.044 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't need to get
rubbed down for this. No.

00:00:11.044 --> 00:00:12.445 line:92%
You have to get your teammate

00:00:12.445 --> 00:00:14.047 align:start size:94% position:6%
