to the person on your right.

00:00:16.149 --> 00:00:18.918
You can make any physical
gesture, say whatever you want,

00:00:18.918 --> 00:00:21.354 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you can't say any word
in the actual clue.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:23.390 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you're holding the buzzer
when it goes off

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:25.825
and it goes like -- BEHR! --
your team loses that round.

00:00:25.825 --> 00:00:27.827
We'll play three rounds.
Let's take our positions.

00:00:27.827 --> 00:00:30.530
